          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Qoomaadae AAKOÓ MUNGÚ una ló'wa harhheehhe'eés niwa kah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‹Aá, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, anuú sagadiyusmoowók a xuú' adór kuúng ira sangw aleesleemuuwók oo úr i laqaán. Asma a mungú gaalá gawaá dooriwo, laqaá baraá yaamuwo oo muruú urén nee oo waa/oo/amo oo adór kwí tleehharo gu aleesláw, kwí kuúng taa tlehhít? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kuúng un firiím ni waaraáhh yaaér Yordaniro, yaamuudá' hhoohhoo' awa bihhaá /uwa Yordaniwo masók i ár, yaamaá ló'wa hhoohhoo' awa tlom'aá hhohhó' koomá', dinkwa nee tlom'aá Lebanoni.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
