        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala aníng tina i buúhh nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ as kuungá', iiárií qaasaro iri sií', kitaangose iri báy, ‹A ido! Ma male ki/aar axweesantisinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsa/ám ay gawaá tsitsinír tloomár Pisga, ta ló'wa qaytsita hhe'és bihhaá /uwa, nee /iya, nee basa, nee bihhaá da/aáw, yaamuudá' ki xuuxú', ala kuúng yaaér Yordani a waarahhká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuúng Yoshua ku hara'arií ó', miwa mune sií' nee i /atli, asma inós mukwí gu geerahaar ay gayuqá', nee yaamuuqá' kuúng taa aán ngiwa aaliya'.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
